This is to build sdcard image for Raspberrypi5:

Parts needed:
1. Raspberry pi 5.
2. Sandisk 64GB SATA SSD with USB cable.
3. Sandisk 64GB micro sdcard.
4. usb3 stick.
5. Host PC with ubuntu 26.04 ( ubuntu-resolute ).
6. ASUS USB-BT500 bluetooth usb dongle.

Note: Compile ubuntu-noble, ubuntu-questing and ubuntu-resolute using lb version 3.0~a57-1.
      Compile debian using lb version 20250814

Steps to build raspberrypi4b and raspberrypi5 sdcard image:

1. git clone https://github.com/philipchen888/build-raspberrypi5.git
   sudo apt update
   sudo apt upgrade
   sudo apt-get install build-essential git libssl-dev nmap net-tools libncurses5-dev libncursesw5-dev dnsutils vsftpd ftp binfmt-support qemu-user-binfmt scons libncurses5-dev libncursesw5-dev libdbus-glib-1-dev libbluetooth-dev python3-dev python3-pip python3-setuptools libcurl4-openssl-dev gettext dbus-x11 chrpath diffstat gawk texinfo curl flex bison device-tree-compiler swig libmpc-dev debootstrap debhelper kpartx gdisk devscripts isolinux po4a libgnutls28-dev mtools python-is-python3 python3-pyelftools gcc-aarch64-linux-gnu p7zip pandoc ffmpeg
   sudo update-binfmts --enable

   cd ~/Downloads
   wget https://github.com/pftf/RPi4/releases/download/v1.50/RPi4_UEFI_Firmware_v1.50.zip
   mv RPi4_UEFI_Firmware_v1.50.zip RPi4_UEFI_Firmware.zip
   wget https://github.com/worproject/rpi5-uefi/releases/download/v0.3/RPi5_UEFI_Release_v0.3.zip
   mv RPi5_UEFI_Release_v0.3.zip RPi5_UEFI_Release.zip

2. Install live-build:
   sudo apt-get install debootstrap debhelper kpartx gdisk devscripts isolinux po4a live-build

   lb --version ( 3.0~a57-1 /usr/bin/lb )

   For forky, trixie and bookworm:
   wget http://deb.debian.org/debian/pool/main/l/live-build/live-build_20250814.tar.xz
   tar xvf live-build_20250814.tar.xz
   cd live-build
   sudo make install
   lb --version ( 20250814 /usr/bin/lb ) 

3. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/kernel ( Compile vendor's kernel )
   git clone https://github.com/raspberrypi/linux --depth=1 -b rpi-7.2.y

   vi ./linux/arch/arm64/configs/bcm2712_defconfig ( delete CONFIG_CMDLINE, change CONFIG_I2C_CHARDEV=m to CONFIG_I2C_CHARDEV=y )
   Use ovmerge to change bcm2712-rpi-5-b.dts to include some dtoverlay ( uart2, vc4, i2c, spi etc.).
   make kernel

4. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/rootfs-bookworm  ( Compile debian bookworm rootfs )
   make rootfs
   The results are in ./linaro-rootfs.img  linaro-esp.img
   make clean

5. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/rootfs-trixie    ( Compile debian trixie rootfs )
   make rootfs
   The results are in ./linaro-rootfs.img  linaro-esp.img
   make clean

6. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/rootfs-forky     ( Compile debian forky rootfs )
   make rootfs
   The results are in ./linaro-rootfs.img  linaro-esp.img
   make clean

7. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/rootfs-ubuntu-noble      ( Compile ubuntu-noble rootfs )
   make rootfs
   The results are in ./linaro-rootfs.img  linaro-esp.img
   make clean

8. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/rootfs-ubuntu-questing    ( Compile ubuntu-questing rootfs )
   make rootfs
   The results are in ./linaro-rootfs.img  linaro-esp.img
   make clean

9. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/rootfs-ubuntu-resolute    ( Compile ubuntu-resolute rootfs )
   make rootfs
   The results are in ./linaro-rootfs.img  linaro-esp.img
   make clean

10. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/bookworm-gnome  ( Build debian bookworm gnome-desktop image )
    Plugin sdcard/usb3 stick to PC.
    sudo ./mksdcardimg.sh
    sudo mount /dev/sda1 /mnt
    sudo 7z x ~/Downloads/RPi5_UEFI_Release.zip -o/mnt && sync && sudo umount /mnt
    Eject sdcard/usb3 stick from PC.

11. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/trixie-gnome  ( Build debian trixie gnome-desktop image )
    Plugin sdcard/usb3 stick to PC.
    sudo ./mksdcardimg.sh
    sudo mount /dev/sda1 /mnt
    sudo 7z x ~/Downloads/RPi5_UEFI_Release.zip -o/mnt && sync && sudo umount /mnt
    Eject sdcard/usb3 stick from PC.

12. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/forky-gnome  ( Build debian forky gnome-desktop image )
    Plugin sdcard/usb3 stick to PC.
    sudo ./mksdcardimg.sh
    sudo mount /dev/sda1 /mnt
    sudo 7z x ~/Downloads/RPi5_UEFI_Release.zip -o/mnt && sync && sudo umount /mnt
    Eject sdcard/usb3 stick from PC.

13. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/ubuntu-noble    ( Build ubuntu-noble image )
    Plugin sdcard/usb3 stick to PC.
    sudo ./mksdcardimg.sh
    sudo mount /dev/sda1 /mnt
    sudo 7z x ~/Downloads/RPi5_UEFI_Release.zip -o/mnt && sync && sudo umount /mnt
    Eject sdcard/usb3 stick from PC.

14. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/ubuntu-questing    ( Build ubuntu-questing image )
    Plugin sdcard/usb3 stick to PC.
    sudo ./mksdcardimg.sh
    sudo mount /dev/sda1 /mnt
    sudo 7z x ~/Downloads/RPi5_UEFI_Release.zip -o/mnt && sync && sudo umount /mnt
    Eject sdcard/usb3 stick from PC.

15. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/ubuntu-resolute    ( Build ubuntu-resolute image )
    Plugin sdcard/usb3 stick to PC.
    sudo ./mksdcardimg.sh
    sudo mount /dev/sda1 /mnt
    sudo 7z x ~/Downloads/RPi5_UEFI_Release.zip -o/mnt && sync && sudo umount /mnt
    Eject sdcard/usb3 stick from PC.

16. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/fedora           ( Build fedora image )

17. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/ubuntu-uefi      ( Build ubuntu-uefi image )

18. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/yocto            ( Build yocto image )

19. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/buildroot        ( Build buildroot image )

20. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/bookworm-flightaware  ( Build flightaware image )

21. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/bookworm-gpio    ( Build gpio and pn532nfc image )

22. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/bookworm-uefi    ( Build bookworm-uefi image )

23. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/trixie-uefi      ( Build trixie-uefi image )

24. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/forky-uefi       ( Build forky-uefi image )

25. cd ~/build-raspberrypi5/android          ( Build android image )
